# Copy to .env and `source .env`, or just export these in your shell.
# Everything here is optional: with none of it set the repo runs on the public,
# unauthenticated endpoints and the default paths under data/manual/.
#
# --- file locations (override the hand-curated inputs) ---------------------
# ECP_HEADLINES=data/manual/ecp_headlines.csv
# ECP_EUA=data/manual/eua_monthly.csv
# ECP_REGIMES=data/manual/regimes.csv
#
# --- ingestion behaviour ---------------------------------------------------
# ECP_OFFLINE=1     reuse cached raw pulls only, never touch the network.
#                   Fails loudly if a series has no cached snapshot, so this
#                   turns a silent partial rebuild into an explicit one.
# ECP_REFRESH=1     ignore the Comext per-cell cache and refetch
#                   (`make data-refresh` sets this for you)
#
# There is no API key anywhere in this repo: ECB SDW, FRED's fredgraph.csv
# endpoint, Comext's SDMX 2.1 API and Eurostat STS are all open.